      "kind": {
        "text": "Chosen because this ledger can already settle propositions of exactly this shape on the `smt-term-level` route by exhaustive evaluation of 4 assignments, so the two routes can be compared on identical content. They are not the same claim and their footprints are not comparable: the SMT route assumes the IR evaluator and classical two-valued Boolean semantics, this one assumes the export pipeline and reaches no Lean axiom. Neither subsumes the other, which is the point of scoping `axiom_footprint` to a route.",
